<title>USA: FREE TO TRADE - Triborough Bridge Authority, N.Y..</title>
<headline>FREE TO TRADE - Triborough Bridge Authority, N.Y..</headline>
<text>
<p>TRIBOROUGH BRIDGE AND TUNNEL AUTHORITY</p>
<p>RE: $201,165,000</p>
<p>GENERAL PURPOSE REVENUE BONDS, SERIES 1996B</p>
<p>Effective at 10:30 EST Monday, Nov 25, 1996, all syndicate terms and price restrictions are removed and the bonds will be free to trade.</p>
<p>PaineWebber Inc</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
